### Sesi 6 - Trial Balance, Period Closing & Audit Trail (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
### Jalankan berurutan pada database seed yang masih baru ("hari ini" = 27 Nov 2026).
@host = http://localhost:8091

############################################################ 1. TRIAL BALANCE

### 1a. Neraca saldo Oktober (LOCKED) - total debit = kredit = 108.500.000
GET {{host}}/api/trial-balance?asOf=2026-10-31
Authorization: Basic auditor1 auditor123

### 1b. Neraca saldo November - jurnal DRAFT (JV-...-00012) & APPROVED (JV-...-00011) TIDAK ikut
GET {{host}}/api/trial-balance?asOf=2026-11-30
Authorization: Basic auditor1 auditor123

### 1c. Worksheet Oktober: sebelum penyesuaian -> penyesuaian -> sesudah penyesuaian
GET {{host}}/api/trial-balance/periods/2026-10/worksheet
Authorization: Basic auditor1 auditor123

### 1d. Neraca saldo Oktober dari snapshot saat lock
GET {{host}}/api/periods/2026-10/trial-balance
Authorization: Basic auditor1 auditor123

### 1e. Export CSV
GET {{host}}/api/trial-balance/export?asOf=2026-10-31
Authorization: Basic auditor1 auditor123

############################################################ 2. PERIOD LOCK MENOLAK POSTING

### 2a. Posting jurnal susulan Oktober -> 422 PERIOD_LOCKED (tercatat REJECTED di audit)
POST {{host}}/api/journals/5/post
Authorization: Basic approver1 approver123
Idempotency-Key: hands-on-post-0005-a
X-Correlation-Id: hands-on-2a

### 2b. Membuat jurnal baru bertanggal Oktober -> 422 PERIOD_LOCKED
POST {{host}}/api/journals
Authorization: Basic accountant1 accountant123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "journalDate": "2026-10-29",
  "description": "Jurnal mundur ke periode yang sudah ditutup",
  "lines": [
    { "accountCode": "5401", "debit": 100000 },
    { "accountCode": "1101", "credit": 100000 }
  ]
}

### 2c. ACCOUNTANT mencoba unlock -> 403 (tercatat DENIED)
POST {{host}}/api/periods/2026-10/unlock
Authorization: Basic accountant1 accountant123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Saya ingin memposting jurnal susulan" }

### 2d. Bukti penolakan di audit log
GET {{host}}/api/audit-events/rejections
Authorization: Basic auditor1 auditor123

############################################################ 3. ADJUSTMENT SETELAH UNLOCK (guided)

### 3a. Unlock tanpa alasan -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/periods/2026-10/unlock
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 3b. Unlock dengan alasan -> SOFT_CLOSED (hanya ADJUSTMENT/REVERSAL yang boleh masuk)
POST {{host}}/api/periods/2026-10/unlock
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Akrual listrik & air Oktober terlewat (memo CFO-17)" }

### 3c. Jurnal GENERAL tetap ditolak saat SOFT_CLOSED -> 422 PERIOD_CUT_OFF
POST {{host}}/api/journals/5/post
Authorization: Basic approver1 approver123
Idempotency-Key: hands-on-post-0005-b

### 3d. Buat jurnal penyesuaian akrual (auto-reverse) -> id 13, AJ-202610-00013
POST {{host}}/api/journals
Authorization: Basic accountant1 accountant123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "journalDate": "2026-10-31",
  "description": "Akrual tagihan listrik & air Oktober",
  "journalType": "ADJUSTMENT",
  "autoReverse": true,
  "lines": [
    { "accountCode": "5301", "description": "Beban listrik & air Oktober", "debit": 650000 },
    { "accountCode": "2102", "description": "Utang biaya listrik", "credit": 650000 }
  ]
}

### 3e. Approve (checker berbeda dari maker)
POST {{host}}/api/journals/13/approve
Authorization: Basic approver1 approver123

### 3f. Post adjustment
POST {{host}}/api/journals/13/post
Authorization: Basic approver1 approver123
Idempotency-Key: hands-on-post-0013

### 3g. Coba lock -> 422 PERIOD_CHECKLIST_FAILED (JV-202610-00005 masih APPROVED)
POST {{host}}/api/periods/2026-10/lock
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### 3h. Checklist
GET {{host}}/api/periods/2026-10/closing-checklist
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### 3i. Reopen (alasan wajib) agar jurnal susulan bisa diposting
POST {{host}}/api/periods/2026-10/reopen
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Posting jurnal susulan ATK Oktober yang sudah disetujui" }

### 3j. Post jurnal susulan
POST {{host}}/api/journals/5/post
Authorization: Basic approver1 approver123
Idempotency-Key: hands-on-post-0005-c

### 3k. Cut-off lalu lock kembali (snapshot saldo dibuat ulang)
POST {{host}}/api/periods/2026-10/cut-off
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

###
POST {{host}}/api/periods/2026-10/lock
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### 3l. Auto-reversal akrual Oktober per 1 November (aman diulang)
POST {{host}}/api/periods/2026-10/auto-reversals
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### 3m. Worksheet Oktober setelah penyesuaian
GET {{host}}/api/trial-balance/periods/2026-10/worksheet
Authorization: Basic auditor1 auditor123

############################################################ 4. REVERSAL KOREKSI NOVEMBER

### 4a. JV-202611-00010 tercatat 12.500.000 (seharusnya 1.250.000) -> reversal
POST {{host}}/api/journals/10/reverse
Authorization: Basic approver1 approver123
Idempotency-Key: hands-on-reverse-0010
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Nominal salah, seharusnya 1.250.000", "reversalDate": "2026-11-27" }

### 4b. Catat ulang dengan nominal benar
POST {{host}}/api/journals
Authorization: Basic accountant2 accountant123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "journalDate": "2026-11-27",
  "description": "Pendapatan jasa konsultasi CV Sinar (koreksi)",
  "lines": [
    { "accountCode": "1102", "debit": 1250000 },
    { "accountCode": "4201", "credit": 1250000 }
  ]
}

############################################################ 5. REKONSILIASI & AUDIT

### 5a. Rekonsiliasi TB -> GL -> jurnal
GET {{host}}/api/reconciliation?asOf=2026-11-30&includeMatched=true
Authorization: Basic auditor1 auditor123

### 5b. Telusuri akun Kas: baris TB -> ledger -> jurnal asal -> audit
GET {{host}}/api/reconciliation/accounts/1101/trace?asOf=2026-11-30
Authorization: Basic auditor1 auditor123

### 5c. Jejak audit periode Oktober (cut-off, lock, unlock, reopen)
GET {{host}}/api/audit-events?entityType=ACCOUNTING_PERIOD&entityRef=2026-10
Authorization: Basic auditor1 auditor123

### 5d. Riwayat versi periode Oktober (Envers)
GET {{host}}/api/periods/2026-10/revisions
Authorization: Basic auditor1 auditor123

### 5e. Riwayat versi jurnal susulan (Envers)
GET {{host}}/api/journals/5/revisions
Authorization: Basic auditor1 auditor123
